PROJECT 'scs_couple' '1'
'3Way coupling WRF-SWAN-ROMS'
''
''

MODE NONSTATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
SET DEPMIN 0.05 INRHOG 1 NAUTICAL PWTAIL 5
COORDINATES SPHERICAL

&& KEYWORD for number of nested SWAN grids.
NSGRIDS 1

&& KEYWORDS TO CREATE AND READ COMPUTATIONAL GRID &&
CGRID CURVILINEAR 89 113 EXC 9.999000e+003 9.999000e+003 CIRCLE 36 0.04 1.0 24
READGRID COORDINATES 1 '/home/thushiyang/model/projects/H1P2/CPL-0/grid/scs_swan_coord.grd' 4 0 0 FREE 

&& KEYWORDS TO CREATE AND READ BATHYMETRY GRID &&
INPGRID BOTTOM CURVILINEAR 0 0 89 113 EXC 9.999000e+003
READINP BOTTOM 1 '/home/thushiyang/model/projects/H1P2/CPL-0/grid/scs_swan_bathy.bot' 4 0 FREE 

&& KEYWORD TO CREATE CURRENT GRID &&
INPGRID CURRENT CURVILINEAR 0 0 89 113 EXC 9.999000e+003 &
       NONSTATIONARY 20171216.000000 1 HR 20171223.000000
 
&& KEYWORD TO CREATE WATER LEVEL GRID &&
INPGRID WLEV CURVILINEAR 0 0 89 113 EXC 9.999000e+003 &
       NONSTATIONARY 20171216.000000 1 HR 20171223.000000

&& KEYWORD TO CREATE BOTTOM FRIC GRID &&
INPGRID FRIC CURVILINEAR 0 0 89 113 EXC 9.999000e+003 &
       NONSTATIONARY 20171216.000000 1 HR 20171223.000000

&& KEYWORD TO CREATE WIND GRID &&
INPGRID WIND REGULAR 99 -5 0 88 112 0.25 0.25 &
       NONSTATIONARY 20171216.000000 1 HR 20171223.000000
READINP WIND 1 '/home/thushiyang/model/projects/H1P2/CPL-0/in/swanforc_HOLLAND_kaitak.dat' 4 0 FREE

& Boundary files  ****************************************
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP PEAK DSPR DEGREES

& here is an example of a constant value along the open boundary
&BOUNDSPEC SEGMENT IJ   0   0   0  63 CONSTANT PAR 0.5 14.0 180. 20.
&BOUNDSPEC SEGMENT IJ   0   0  83   0 CONSTANT PAR 0.5 14.0 180. 20.
&BOUNDSPEC SEGMENT IJ  83   0  83  63 CONSTANT PAR 0.5 14.0 0. 20.

& PHYSICS  ****************************************
GEN3 KOMEN 1.18E-5 3.02E-3
WCAPping KOMEN 1.18E-5 3.02E-3 2.0 1.0 1.0
BREaking CONSTANT 1.0 0.73
FRICtion MADSEN 0.05
TRIad
QUADrupl
TURBulence CURRENT
&DIFFRACtion
&SSWELL

&OFF WINDGrowth
&OFF QUADrupl
&OFF WCAPping
&OFF BREaking
&OFF REFrac
&OFF FSHift
PROP BSBT

& outputs  ****************************************
